```
MCP 架构:

+------------------+     +------------------+
| Claude Code      |     | MCP Server       |
|                  |     | (外部工具)        |
| Tool definitions | <-- | Expose tools     |
| Tool calls       | --> | Execute tools    |
| Tool results     | <-- | Return results   |
+------------------+     +------------------+

配置文件 (.claude/settings.json):
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "filesystem": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["@anthropic-ai/mcp-filesystem", "/path/to/dir"]
    },
    "github": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["@anthropic-ai/mcp-github"],
      "env": {
        "GITHUB_TOKEN": "${GITHUB_TOKEN}"
      }
    }
  }
}

可用的 MCP 服务器:
- @anthropic-ai/mcp-filesystem
- @anthropic-ai/mcp-github
- @anthropic-ai/mcp-postgres
- @anthropic-ai/mcp-slack
- @anthropic-ai/mcp-google-drive
```

1. **安装 MCP 服务器**: 使用 npm 安装。

```bash
npm install -g @anthropic-ai/mcp-filesystem
npm install -g @anthropic-ai/mcp-github
```

2. **配置 MCP 服务器**: 在 `.claude/settings.json` 中定义。

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "filesystem": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["@anthropic-ai/mcp-filesystem", "./project"]
    },
    "github": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["@anthropic-ai/mcp-github"],
      "env": {
        "GITHUB_TOKEN": "${GITHUB_TOKEN}"
      }
    },
    "postgres": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["@anthropic-ai/mcp-postgres"],
      "env": {
        "DATABASE_URL": "${DATABASE_URL}"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

3. **使用 MCP 工具**: Claude 自动发现并调用。

